    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual fish-raising game, relaxing gameplay with no feeding required</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Picture wallpapers, video wallpapers, background music, fully customizable</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in gaming console with various mini-games and video playback</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes a range of practical tools</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide taskbar icon, show tray icon with tray menu support<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498710/extras/fe190039b2b2820ddb55ad302ed8b1c0.avif?t=1750340748\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498710/extras/b7d0aded69e646d04e14e2681d7ffac5.avif?t=1750340748\" data-has-big width=800 height=384 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498710/extras/d23e4aaadaff383da5f454611ba34d73.avif?t=1750340748\" data-has-big width=800 height=350 /></span></p></li></ul>",
